_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 12
---
order: 12
---
short_label: VII.12
---
statement: If any number of numbers are proportional, then one of the antecedents is to one of the consequents as the sum of the antecedents is to the sum of the consequents.
---
proof:

<figure class="diagram">
